abstract: >-
  An open-source, strictly U(N) gauge-invariant PyTorch CUDA computational physics testbed
  unifying Hartree-Fock-Bogoliubov (HFB) matrix wave-packets, exact 2-flavor Bogoliubov-de Gennes
  (BdG) link fermions, U(N)-singlet Gauss-law edge modes, adjoint Dirac matter backreaction,
  O(N^3) matrix-native large-N scaling, emergent U(2) Higgs gauge bosons, and topologically
  protected Ginsparg-Wilson chiral fermion generations on consumer GPUs.
